msgid "Vendor Runtime Module"
msgstr "供应商运行模块"

msgid ""
"A Vendor Runtime Module is a :ref:`Godot module <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` "
"which is only applicable at runtime in a running project. It is created like "
"a regular :ref:`custom C++ module <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>`, but is "
"packaged using an :ref:`editor plugin <doc_making_plugins>` to make the "
"functionality it provides easily accessible and usable within a *stock* "
"Godot project."
msgstr ""
"供应商运行时模块是一种 :ref:`Godot 模块 <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>`，仅在运"
"行中的项目中有效。它与常规的 :ref:`自定义 C++ 模块 "
"<doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` 类似，但使用 :ref:`编辑器插件 "
"<doc_making_plugins>` 进行打包，以便在标准 *Godot* 项目中轻松访问和使用其功"
"能。"

msgid "What for?"
msgstr "可以做什么？"

msgid ""
"Vendor runtime modules provide developers with access to vendor-specific "
"optimizations, features, and/or platforms for their running projects."
msgstr ""
"供应商运行时模块为开发者提供访问其运行项目所需的供应商特定优化、功能和/或平台"
"的方式。"

msgid ""
"This provides benefits to vendors who are able to expose their technologies "
"to all developers, and improve and refine them in a rapid, iterative, and "
"frictionless manner. This also provides benefits to developers and users who "
"are able to access and use a diverse range of vendor technologies to improve "
"their games."
msgstr ""
"这为能够将其技术展示给所有开发者，并以快速、迭代和无缝的方式改进和完善的供应"
"商提供了好处。这也为能够访问和使用各种供应商技术以改进其游戏的开发者和用户提"
"供了好处。"

msgid "Creating a vendor runtime module"
msgstr "创建供应商运行时模块"

msgid "Generating export templates"
msgstr "生成导出模板"

msgid ""
"Make sure to follow the :ref:`instructions for creating a custom C++ module "
"<doc_creating_custom_modules_in_cpp>`."
msgstr ""
"确保遵循 :ref:`创建自定义C++模块的说明 <doc_creating_custom_modules_in_cpp>`."

msgid ""
"Since this is a runtime module whose functionality is meant to only be "
"accessed from the running project, you must generate an export template for "
"every platform you plan to support. See the :ref:`Compiling <toc-devel-"
"compiling>` pages for more information."
msgstr ""
"由于这是一个运行时模块，其功能仅设计为从运行中的项目访问，因此你必须为计划支"
"持的每个平台生成导出模板。有关更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`编译 <toc-devel-"
"compiling>` 页面。"

msgid "Creating the wrapper editor plugin"
msgstr "正在创建包装编辑器插件"

msgid ""
"Once the export templates are generated, you must create an editor plugin to "
"package them and make them easily accessible to end users via the `Godot "
"Asset Store <https://store.godotengine.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"一旦导出模板生成，你必须创建一个编辑器插件来打包它们，并通过 `Godot Asset "
"Store <https://store.godotengine.org/>`_ 方便最终用户使用。"

msgid ""
"Follow :ref:`these instructions <doc_making_plugins_template>` to start "
"creating the plugin. Your base plugin script should look like the following:"
msgstr ""
"请遵循 :ref:`这些说明 <doc_making_plugins_template>` 开始创建插件。您的插件基"
"础脚本应如下所示："

msgid ""
"The next step is to define and instantiate "
"an :ref:`EditorExportPlugin<class_EditorExportPlugin>` instance. "
"The :ref:`EditorExportPlugin<class_EditorExportPlugin>` instance is used to "
"hook into the export flow and replace the default export templates with the "
"ones generated from the vendor runtime module."
msgstr ""
"下一步是定义并实例化一个 :ref:`EditorExportPlugin<class_EditorExportPlugin>` "
"实例。该 :ref:`EditorExportPlugin<class_EditorExportPlugin>` 实例用于接入导出"
"流程，并将默认的导出模板替换为由供应商运行时模块生成的模板。"

msgid ""
"Using our base editor plugin template code above, an example implementation "
"looks like this:"
msgstr "使用我们上面提供的基于编辑器的插件模板代码，一个示例实现如下："

msgid ""
"This section covers the basics to wrap and expose a vendor runtime module "
"via an editor plugin, but editor plugins have a lot more functionality that "
"can be used to customize the editor further. Feel free to :ref:`explore and "
"leverage those functionalities <toc-tutorials-plugins>` to improve the user "
"experience for your vendor runtime module."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍了通过编辑器插件封装和暴露供应商运行时模块的基础知识，但编辑器插件具"
"有更多功能，可用于进一步自定义编辑器。您可以自由地：:ref:`探索和利用那些功能 "
"<toc-tutorials-plugins>`，以提升您的供应商运行时模块的用户体验。"
